{"headword":"חוּל","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">[חִיל]</span> <strong>vb.</strong> whirl, dance, writhe <strong>(</strong>NH, Aramaic <em>id.</em>, <em>dance;</em> Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">حَاَل</span> <em>change, turn;</em> Assyrian <em>ḫîlu, writhe</em> in fear Dl<sup>Pr 191</sup> (on <em>ḫ</em> = ح v. DHM<sup>ZK i. 357</sup>); on form of Heb. <strong>vb.</strong> v. Nö<sup>ZMG, 1883, 536</sup><strong>)</strong>—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">חָ֫לָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 1:12\" href=\"/Micah.1.12\">Mi 1:12</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחָלָה֫</span> consec. <a data-ref=\"Hosea 11:6\" href=\"/Hosea.11.6\">Ho 11:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חַלְתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 23:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.23.4\">Is 23:4</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חָ֫לוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:3\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.3\">Je 5:3</a> (but v. infr.), <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:6\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.6\">La 4:6</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וְחָלוּ֫</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:25\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.25\">Dt 2:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">חַ֫לְנוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.18\">Is 26:18</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָחוּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.19\">Je 23:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.23\">30:23</a>; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּחוּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.30.16\">Ez 30:16</a> Qr (Kt Co <span dir=\"rtl\">תחיל</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתָּחֹ֑ל</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:29\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.29\">Je 51:29</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אחולה</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.19\">Je 4:19</a> Kt (Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">אוֹחִילָה</span>, Hiph. <span dir=\"rtl\">יחל</span>); <span dir=\"rtl\">יָחֻ֫לוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:29\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.29\">2 S 3:29</a>; but also <span dir=\"rtl\">יָחִיל</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 55:5\" href=\"/Psalms.55.5\">ψ 55:5</a> (<a data-ref=\"Job 20:21\" href=\"/Job.20.21\">Jb 20:21</a> v. ii. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חול\" href=\"/BDB,_חול\", dir=\"rtl\">חול</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּ֫חֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 31:3\" href=\"/I_Samuel.31.3\">1 S 31:3</a> = <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 10:3\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.10.3\">1 Ch 10:3</a> + <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:10\" href=\"/Genesis.8.10\">Gn 8:10</a> (where read prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּיָּ֫חֶל</span> as v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:12\" href=\"/Genesis.8.12\">12</a>; = <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיְיַחֵל</span> Ol Di); 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּחִיל</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 26:17\" href=\"/Isaiah.26.17\">Is 26:17</a> + 2 times + <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:16\" href=\"/Ezekiel.30.16\">Ez 30:16</a> Kt (cf. supr.); <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתָּ֑חֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 97:4\" href=\"/Psalms.97.4\">ψ 97:4</a>; 2 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּחִלִין</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 45:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.45.10\">Is 45:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">יָחִילוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:17\" href=\"/Psalms.77.17\">ψ 77:17</a> = 3 times (<a data-ref=\"Psalms 10:5\" href=\"/Psalms.10.5\">ψ 10:5</a> v. ii. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חול\" href=\"/BDB,_חול\", dir=\"rtl\">חול</a>); <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּחִ֫ילוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 3:25\" href=\"/Judges.3.25\">Ju 3:25</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַחִילוּן</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.8\">Is 13:8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">תָּחִ֫ילוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:22\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.22\">Je 5:22</a>; Imv. fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">חוּ֫לִי</span> <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:10\" href=\"/Micah.4.10\">Mi 4:10</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 114:7\" href=\"/Psalms.114.7\">ψ 114:7</a>; mpl. <span dir=\"rtl\">חִילוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 96:9\" href=\"/Psalms.96.9\">ψ 96:9</a> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 16:30\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.16.30\">1 Ch 16:30</a>; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">(לָ)חוּל</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:21\" href=\"/Judges.21.21\">Ju 21:21</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 30:16\" 