n dir=\"rtl\">דמים</span>—of Abner, from sword) <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 3:29\" href=\"/II_Samuel.3.29\">2 S 3:29</a>; of attach of sword itself <a data-ref=\"Hosea 11:6\" href=\"/Hosea.11.6\">Ho 11:6</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּלָּה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אכל</span>), cf. <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:6\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.6\">La 4:6</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">לא חָ֫לוּ בה ידים</span>; of tempest <span dir=\"rtl\">על ראשׁ רשׁעים יחול</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 23:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.23.19\">Je 23:19</a> (v a <span dir=\"rtl\">סער מִתְחוֹלֵל</span>) = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 30:23\" href=\"/Jeremiah.30.23\">30:23</a> (v a <span dir=\"rtl\">סַעַר מִתְגּוֹרֵר</span>)."}],"num":"3."}],"form":"Qal"},{"senses":[{"definition":"Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְחוֹלֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 29:9\" href=\"/Psalms.29.9\">ψ 29:9</a>; 3 fs. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּחוֹלֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.23\">Pr 25:23</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּחוֹלֶלְכֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.2\">Is 51:2</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">תְּחוֹלֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 35:14\" href=\"/Job.35.14\">Jb 35:14</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתְּחוֹלֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 90:2\" href=\"/Psalms.90.2\">ψ 90:2</a>; Inf. cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹלֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 39:1\" href=\"/Job.39.1\">Jb 39:1</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מְחוֹלֵל</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.10\">Pr 26:10</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מְחֹלֶלְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.18\">Dt 32:18</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מְחֹלְלוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:23\" href=\"/Judges.21.23\">Ju 21:23</a>;—<a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.6\">1 S 18:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 87:7\" href=\"/Psalms.87.7\">ψ 87:7</a> v infr.; on <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:9\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.9\">Is 51:9</a> and <a data-ref=\"Job 26:13\" href=\"/Job.26.13\">Jb 26:13</a> v. <a ,=\"\" data-ref=\"BDB, חָלַל\" dir=\"rtl\" href=\"/BDB,_חָלַל\">I. חלל</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>dance</em> <a data-ref=\"Judges 21:23\" href=\"/Judges.21.23\">Ju 21:23</a>, so perhaps also <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 18:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.18.6\">1 S 18:6</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">חַמְּחֹלְלוֹת</span> 𝔊 We Dr; and <span dir=\"rtl\">חֹלֲלִים</span> pt. (<span dir=\"rtl\">מ</span> om.) <a data-ref=\"Psalms 87:7\" href=\"/Psalms.87.7\">ψ 87:7</a> RV Pe De Che Bae; cf. <strong>Qal 1</strong>)."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>writhe</em> in travail <em>with, bear, bring forth</em> (poet.), of Sarah, mother of Isr., <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 51:2\" href=\"/Isaiah.51.2\">Is 51:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אַבְרָהָם אֲבִיכֶם</span>); of hinds <a data-ref=\"Job 39:1\" href=\"/Job.39.1\">Jb 39:1</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 29:9\" href=\"/Psalms.29.9\">ψ 29:9</a> (caus.); fig. of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s producing earth <a data-ref=\"Psalms 90:2\" href=\"/Psalms.90.2\">ψ 90:2</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">יֻלָּד֑וּ</span>); of his bringing forth Isr. (with difficulty, v. Di) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 32:18\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.32.18\">Dt 32:18</a>; of north wind bringing forth rain <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:23\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.23\">Pr 25:23</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">רַב מְחוֹלֵל כֹּ֑ל</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.10\">26:10</a> <em>a master produceth everything</em> (on trans. see VB; Ew. al. derive from <span dir=\"rtl\">חלל</span> <em>wound</em>)."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>wait anxiously</em> (cf. <strong>Qal 2 d</strong>), sq. <span dir=\"rtl\">לְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 35:14\" href=\"/Job.35.14\">Jb 35:14</a> (Elihu)."}],"num":"3."}],"form":"Poʿlel."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Pf. <span dir=\"rtl\">חוֹלָ֑לתִּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 51:7\" href=\"/Psalms.51.7\">ψ 51:7</a> + 2 times; <span dir=\"rtl\">חוֹלָ֑לְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 15:7\" href=\"/Job.15.7\">Jb 15:7</a>; Impf. <span dir=\"rtl\">יְחוֹלָ֑לוּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 26:5\" href=\"/Job.